# One Last Job's "target Mount or Vehicle card" names a creature type, read through the words of the spell's own text (CR 612.2).
# Bot1 casts its Mount-or-Vehicle mode on turn 3 targeting Bulwark Ox, a Mount. In response Bot2's Artificial Evolution changes
# Mount to Thopter in the spell's text: as One Last Job resolves the Ox is no Thopter and no Vehicle, so its only target is illegal
# and the spell does not resolve (CR 608.2b): the Ox stays in the graveyard. The Moxen pay {2}{W} + {1} exactly (white from Pearl).

